  "content": {
    "_uid": "d4ddc8f8-3935-ddc5-7e65-55733fcc06e3",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "55fe17d0-4632-0f23-9599-a0f09eb7096f",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The criteria of the competition, announced on the national level, included the quality of EHS Management Program, Leadership Commitment, Staff Participation, Goals and Objectives, Training Programs and Progress, EHS Departmental Setup, Incident Reporting and Analysis, Emergency Preparedness, Employee Health Monitoring Program, and Performance Monitoring, Measurement and Improvement. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Relevant data and record for the year 2011 and 2012 was collected from various organizations and analyzed/compared to identify award winners. Organizations representing various sectors submitted their nominations. AKU was judged, by an independent panel of judges, to exhibit the outstanding OSHE performance in the service sector.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
