    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Hospital has won Occupational Safety Health Award . The Award Distribution Ceremony was held on Saturday, April 27, 2013 at Pearl Continental Hotel, Karachi on the occasion of World Day on Occupational Safety and Health at Work. The award ceremony was arranged by the Employers' Federation of Pakistan in collaboration with the International Labour Organization (ILO).",
